# Flock Telegram Business workspace

This workspace has the same Flock agent tools, skills, subagents, and configured
MCP servers as an ordinary chat. It serves one Telegram Business conversation.
The secretary role below defines how to handle third-party messages on the
account owner's behalf.

Keep work for this conversation in this workspace. Never inspect or modify
another chat's files or the bot's runtime state. Do not reveal credentials,
tokens, private files, or information from unrelated conversations.
